{
  "id": "c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "The cost of fashion",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you decide what to buy when you go shopping?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think you buy more than you need?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you do with clothes you no longer wear?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it for you to know where a product comes from?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e06-a1",
            "c1-e06-a2",
            "c1-e06-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different attitudes to clothes. Choose two of the pictures and say what these attitudes reveal about the people, and what the consequences of their behaviour might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these attitudes is closest to your own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e06-b1",
            "c1-e06-b2",
            "c1-e06-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show different parts of the clothing industry. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be thinking, and what problems might arise in this industry.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think consumers have a duty to find out how their clothes are made?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to make the clothing industry more sustainable, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures help to reduce the impact of the fashion industry?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about sustainable consumption and fast fashion.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is it fair to ask consumers to take responsibility for ethical shopping?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it realistic to expect people to pay more for clothes that are made responsibly?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think advertising encourages us to buy things we do not need?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Has the pressure to look fashionable become more intense with social media?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should governments ban companies from destroying unsold clothes?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, could a society ever completely move away from a throwaway culture?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e06-the-cost-of-fashion/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
